  "content": "<img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Highlight/BH_H_Title.png\">\n<p></p>\n<img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Highlight/BH_H_Overview.png\">\n<p></p>\n<center><p>此模組改變了遊戲中特定方塊的可視化效果，這些方塊通常具有軸向對齊的選擇框，將其改為傾斜的選擇框，以匹配它們的模型，並整體改善方塊的外觀。</p></center>\n<p></p>\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/34ZhTuy.png\">\n<p></p>\n<a href=\"https://resourceful-bees.gitbook.io/resourceful-lib/highlights\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Highlight/BH_H_Wiki.png\"></a>\n<p></p>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/resourcefulbees\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Highlight/BH_H_Discord.png\"></a>\n<p></p>\n<a href=\"https://bisecthosting.com/teamresourceful\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Highlight/BH_H_BisectPromo.png\"></a>",
